{{!
    @template local_dictionaries/import_report

    Message of a CSV import that rejected rows: the summary, the first rejected rows with
    their line numbers, and how many more were not listed.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * summary - import summary text
    * rows - list of rejected rows, each with text
    * hashidden - whether some rejected rows are not listed
    * hidden - number of rejected rows not listed

    Example context (json):
    {
        "summary": "Import completed. Inserted: 2, Updated: 0, Ignored: 0, Duplicates: 0, Rejected: 1.",
        "rows": [
            {"text": "Line 3: fewer than two columns."}
        ],
        "hashidden": true,
        "hidden": 4
    }
}}
<div class="local-dictionaries-import-report">
    <p>{{summary}}</p>
    <ul>
        {{#rows}}
        <li>{{text}}</li>
        {{/rows}}
    </ul>
    {{#hashidden}}
    <p>{{#str}}csvrejectedhidden, local_dictionaries, {{hidden}}{{/str}}</p>
    {{/hashidden}}
</div>
